---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---
<Page title="How we review products" description={`The editorial standards behind ${site.name}.`} updated="October 16, 2026">
  <p>Every article on {site.name} follows the same process.</p>
  <h2>What we look at</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The full ingredient list and the amounts the company discloses.</li>
    <li>The official sales page, including pricing, shipping, guarantee and refund terms.</li>
    <li>Published research on the ingredients or approach, with links so you can read it yourself.</li>
    <li>Who should avoid the product or talk to a professional first.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>What we don't do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We don't publish invented testimonials or before-and-after photos.</li>
    <li>We don't claim a supplement cures or treats any disease.</li>
    <li>We don't present a study on one ingredient or strain as proof that a finished product works.</li>
    <li>We don't let affiliate commissions decide what we say about a product.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Updates and corrections</h2>
  <p>Prices and terms change, so each article shows the date it was last updated. If we get something wrong, we fix it and note significant corrections. You can report an error through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
</Page>
